00:04:11.060 --> 00:04:13.070
Wow, that's really sweet.

00:04:13.550 --> 00:04:15.350
Almost makes me feel bad for making the

00:04:15.350 --> 00:04:16.430
whole thing up.

00:04:16.640 --> 00:04:18.500
What trick?

00:04:19.070 --> 00:04:20.720
She never been to a nut house?

00:04:20.750 --> 00:04:21.830
No.

00:04:21.860 --> 00:04:23.360
Yeah. Ain't crazy.

00:04:23.360 --> 00:04:25.160
I mean, I've been to rehab a few times, but

00:04:25.160 --> 00:04:26.770
that was just for paid vacation.

00:04:26.780 --> 00:04:29.150
You lied just to make me feel bad.

00:04:29.180 --> 00:04:32.630
No, no, we lied so that we could win with our

00:04:32.630 --> 00:04:34.430
