00:04:34.460 --> 00:04:35.810
That is so messed up.

00:04:35.840 --> 00:04:37.010
Did you say horrors?

00:04:37.040 --> 00:04:37.400
No, no, it.

00:04:37.400 --> 00:04:39.710
Ain't messed up. The saying is trick or

00:04:39.710 --> 00:04:41.540
