00:04:41.540 --> 00:04:42.140
Yeah.

00:04:42.290 --> 00:04:44.250
Our yard is full of dead whores.

00:04:44.270 --> 00:04:45.920
You got a Santa?

00:04:45.950 --> 00:04:46.370
Yep.

00:04:46.400 --> 00:04:47.690
Horrors! I heard it again. Why are we not

00:04:47.690 --> 00:04:48.650
