00:04:48.770 --> 00:04:51.290
There will come a day when you will pay for

00:04:51.290 --> 00:04:53.270
this. You won't know when.

00:04:53.270 --> 00:04:56.480
And you won't know how, but you will feel

00:04:56.480 --> 00:04:56.930
it.

00:05:01.810 --> 00:05:04.520
Wow. That chick is scary.

00:05:04.970 --> 00:05:05.690
Thank you.

00:05:06.140 --> 00:05:07.820
You have no idea.

